    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721290/extras/dacd21e4e5c9bfd47d65dcb73437e211.avif?t=1707554578\" width=600 height=450 /></span><br>The fairy tale world has been invaded, and various monsters from other worlds have suddenly appeared in their homes, seeking to absorb the power of the magic crystal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721290/extras/9c56755d9d47b31c383b9f67755f34b6.avif?t=1707554578\" width=600 height=450 /></span><br>In various types of levels, players need to carefully observe the path of monsters, use resources reasonably, and build turrets to defend against them. At the same time, they can use various powerful magic to inflict large-scale damage on the enemy and protect the magic power of the crystal from being absorbed by monsters!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721290/extras/dacd21e4e5c9bfd47d65dcb73437e211.avif?t=1707554578\" width=600 height=450 /></span><br>The fairy tale world has been invaded, and various monsters from other worlds have suddenly appeared in their homes, seeking to absorb the power of the magic crystal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721290/extras/9c56755d9d47b31c383b9f67755f34b6.avif?t=1707554578\" width=600 height=450 /></span><br>In various types of levels, players need to carefully observe the path of monsters, use resources reasonably, and build turrets to defend against them. At the same time, they can use various powerful magic to inflict large-scale damage on the enemy and protect the magic power of the crystal from being absorbed by monsters!",
    "short_description": "A classic tower defense game, ready to build dozens of turrets and use dozens of magic to destroy monsters?",
